  "steps": [
    "Sweet potato sandwich: Heat the oven to 400°F. Prick the sweet potatoes with a fork and bake on a foil-lined sheet 45-50 min, until a knife slides in with no resistance. Let cool 5 min.",
    "Sweet potato sandwich: Cook the turkey bacon in a nonstick skillet over medium heat 3-4 min per side until crisp. Wipe the pan, add the oil, and cook the egg and egg whites over medium-low, folding, until set with no runny white.",
    "Sweet potato sandwich: Split each sweet potato and press it flat with a spatula to make two rounds of \"bread\". Layer the egg, cheese, turkey bacon and avocado between them.",
    "Big Mac bowl: Heat the oven to 450°F and line a sheet pan with parchment. Pat the potato cubes dry, toss with the olive oil and a pinch of salt, and roast 30 min, tossing halfway, until crisp and golden.",
    "Big Mac bowl: Stir together the yogurt, ketchup, relish, vinegar and salt.",
    "Big Mac bowl: Brown the beef in a skillet over medium-high heat with a pinch of salt and pepper, breaking it up, 6-8 min until no pink remains (160°F).",
    "Big Mac bowl: Pile the lettuce, tomato, onion and pickles in a bowl, top with the potatoes and beef, and spoon on the burger sauce.",
    "Chicken pizza: Heat the oven to 400°F and line a baking sheet with parchment. Mix the ground chicken, oat flour and garlic salt, then press it into a round about 1/4 in thick.",
    "Chicken pizza: Bake the crust about 20 min, until lightly golden and cooked through (165°F). Blot off any liquid on top.",
    "Chicken pizza: Spread on the pizza sauce, scatter the mozzarella, and bake 6-10 min more until the cheese melts. Top with parsley."
  ],
